{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01033",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.0,
      "end_seconds": 4.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Hello, good to see you. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.45,
      "end_seconds": 8.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.42,
      "end_seconds": 12.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Did you come far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.67,
      "end_seconds": 18.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.67,
      "text": "Not too far, about half an hour by bus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.41,
      "end_seconds": 21.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.02,
      "end_seconds": 28.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a tight band around my head."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.82,
      "end_seconds": 36.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.21,
      "end_seconds": 46.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.8,
      "end_seconds": 80.17,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, blood pressure 113 over 81. And pulse 86, temperature is 36.8 degrees, respiratory rate 17. How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.61,
      "end_seconds": 85.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Since last weekend, that's when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.87,
      "end_seconds": 96.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "So, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.67,
      "end_seconds": 107.82,
      "duration_seconds": 10.15,
      "text": "I notice it more with stress. I get some relief from a warm shower and a walk. I'd call it moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.54,
      "end_seconds": 111.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.74,
      "end_seconds": 122.11,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a stiff neck as well. And there's tired eyes as well, two months now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.21,
      "end_seconds": 125.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "And blurred vision, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.98,
      "end_seconds": 131.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Hmm, no, none, no blurred vision."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.85,
      "end_seconds": 136.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Have you had any weakness, sickness or sensitivity to light?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.45,
      "end_seconds": 142.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "No, no weakness, sickness or sensitivity to light."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.38,
      "end_seconds": 145.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.72,
      "end_seconds": 148.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.87,
      "end_seconds": 154.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.36,
      "end_seconds": 157.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.33,
      "end_seconds": 169.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.09,
      "end_seconds": 173.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.05,
      "end_seconds": 178.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.0,
      "end_seconds": 192.77,
      "duration_seconds": 12.77,
      "text": "Yes, gout. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.06,
      "end_seconds": 195.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.33,
      "end_seconds": 201.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.95,
      "end_seconds": 210.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.7,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Yes, gout and an underactive thyroid are known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.93,
      "end_seconds": 226.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.32,
      "end_seconds": 237.61,
      "duration_seconds": 10.29,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. My husband and I live above the shop. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.73,
      "end_seconds": 257.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.39,
      "end_seconds": 264.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Thyronorm. I take it 50 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.87,
      "end_seconds": 268.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "When did you start it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.88,
      "end_seconds": 271.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "About nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.56,
      "end_seconds": 275.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.02,
      "end_seconds": 278.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.69,
      "end_seconds": 283.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Okay, time for me to examine you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.99,
      "end_seconds": 286.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.11,
      "end_seconds": 289.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.91,
      "end_seconds": 302.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "Your neck and shoulder muscles are tight, and your eye movements are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.1,
      "end_seconds": 305.04,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.78,
      "end_seconds": 321.19,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Taking everything into account, my working impression is tension-type headache. It could also be eye strain, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.37,
      "end_seconds": 324.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.44,
      "end_seconds": 339.8,
      "duration_seconds": 14.36,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's tension-type headache, and we'll watch how it goes. Take screen breaks every hour and try regular neck stretches. Please come and see me in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.99,
      "end_seconds": 345.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Uh, I'll book it on my way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.77,
      "end_seconds": 349.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.44,
      "end_seconds": 353.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Thank you, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.43,
      "end_seconds": 355.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}